# Git pre-commit hook (MANDATORY for agents)

The zip rebuild hook lives in `.githooks/pre-commit`. Git does not install it on clone. It runs locally, before the commit, on this machine only.

## Session start

Before any other work, verify the hook is installed. If the check fails, tell the user you are installing the pre-commit hook, then run the installer:

```bash
test -x .git/hooks/pre-commit && grep -q 'make-zips.sh' .git/hooks/pre-commit || bash qa/install-git-hooks.sh
```

Do not set `core.hooksPath`. The installer copies `.githooks/pre-commit` into `.git/hooks/pre-commit`.
